---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
const pageSlug = 'features-backup-restore';
const articleLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'Encrypted backup and restore',
  description: 'Export an encrypted Vireault backup file and restore it on another Android phone. Includes auto-lock and screenshot blocking.',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Vireault' },
  datePublished: '2026-11-05',
  dateModified: '2026-11-05',
  mainEntityOfPage: 'https://vireault.app/features/backup-restore',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Encrypted backup and restore"
  description="Create an encrypted Vireault backup file, restore on a new phone, and rely on auto-lock plus screenshot blocking day to day."
  path="/features/backup-restore"
  pageSlug={pageSlug}
  ogType="article"
  jsonLd={articleLd}
  article={{ published: '2026-11-05', modified: '2026-11-05' }}
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/features', label: 'Features' }, { label: 'Backup & restore' }]} />
    <article class="section prose">
      <h1>Encrypted backup and restore</h1>
      <p>Local-only storage still needs an escape hatch when you change phones. Vireault lets you export an encrypted backup file and restore it later.</p>
      <h2>Backup basics</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Export an encrypted backup file you control</li>
        <li>Restore on a new device with your recovery material</li>
        <li>Keep recovery codes offline and private</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If you forget your unlock secret and lose recovery material, nobody can reconstruct the vault — including us. That is the cost of not holding keys on a server.</p>
      <Cta pageSlug={pageSlug} heading="Back up before you switch phones" />
      <h2>Day-to-day protections</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Auto-lock when the app goes to the background</li>
        <li>Auto-lock after about 5 minutes idle</li>
        <li>Screenshot blocking while using the vault</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Learn more in <a href="/features/encryption">encryption</a>, <a href="/features/offline">offline design</a>, <a href="/guides/encrypt-files-on-android">encrypting files on Android</a>, and <a href="/guides/photo-vault-lost-photos-android">what to do if a photo vault loses photos</a>.</p>
    </article>
    <Cta pageSlug={pageSlug} />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
